    {
      "id": "f8ba489743d74bda2a58595155d81eff4f6885ff",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 726152904,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Tested in master using the following `io_graphs` content:\n\nPre-3.6:\n```\n# This file is automatically generated, DO NOT MODIFY.\n\"Enabled\",\"All Packets\",\"\",\"#2E3436\",\"Line\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\"\n\"Enabled\",\"TCP Errors\",\"tcp.analysis.flags\",\"#A40000\",\"Bar\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\"\n```\nLoads without error or warnings. Y Axis Factor is set to 1 for each graph. Modifying a graph saves settings with the Y Axis Factor field present.\n\n3.6:\n```\n# This file is automatically generated, DO NOT MODIFY.\n\"Enabled\",\"All Packets\",\"\",\"#2E3436\",\"Line\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\",\"1\"\n\"Enabled\",\"TCP Errors\",\"tcp.analysis.flags\",\"#A40000\",\"Bar\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\",\"1\"\n```\nLoads without error or warnings.\n\n3.6 with extra data:\n```\n# This file is automatically generated, DO NOT MODIFY.\n\"Enabled\",\"All Packets\",\"\",\"#2E3436\",\"Line\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\",\"1\",\"Extra\"\n\"Enabled\",\"TCP Errors\",\"tcp.analysis.flags\",\"#A40000\",\"Bar\",\"Packets\",\"\",\"None\",\"1\"\n```\nLoads with the warning\n\n```\n ** (wireshark:36787) 14:43:55.665550 [UAT WARNING] -- io_graphs:2: More fields than required. Discarding ,\"Extra\"\n```\n\nModifying a graph saves settings without the \"Extra\" field.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789948913",
